# UI Evolution Pass: Roadmap Preparation

This pass modernizes the frontend interface to reflect the project's long-term roadmap. We will introduce interactive source selection for "Old" and "New" data sources, while keeping the current V1 "SQL Dump" workflow active and stable.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Functional Scope**: All Phase 8 (Database Connection) and Phase 9 (Legacy Application) controls will be visually integrated but functionally disabled. The system will continue to rely on the existing `POST /upload` endpoint for the V1 SQL Dump workflow.
>
> **Layout Shift**: The "Source Data Ingestion" area will be reorganized into logical segments: Excel Master, Old Source, and New Source.

